      "message": "Fold tokens and sessions into settings, and give people, teams and owners their rows\n\nSettings is one page with a sub-navigation and a panel per section:\nthe address, how you sign in (passkeys, a linked provider, the\npassword), tokens, where you are signed in, and appearance with the\nthree-way theme. Tokens and sessions used to be pages of their own;\ntheir addresses now answer a permanent redirect into the section, and\nthe forms that mint, revoke and sign out land back on it.\n\nPeople is a panel of rows: the avatar, the display name, the username\nand their standing in words, and the controls on the right; adding one\nis a form of fields labelled Username, not Name. Teams are cards like\nagents: members as chips each with its own remove, a way to add one,\nwhat the team holds, and granting folded behind a control. An owner's\npage opens with their avatar and a chip saying what they are, then\nrepositories as rows, the allowance as a panel of what is used of what\nis allowed, and for an organisation its members with a way to add one.\n\nChange-Id: Iwork0130b\nTask: t-30s8ez8w1hwr4e542techgmzm9\nSigned-off-by: Mandip Adhikari <92096340+mandipadk@users.noreply.github.com>",
